{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astropark</strong> is an immersive single-player VR game that invites players to explore the wonders of our universe through hands-on, interactive experiences. <br><br><strong>Designed for ages 13</strong> and up, the game is set in a stylized space-themed park where each area represents a real celestial body\u2014such as the Moon, Europa, or Saturn. Players engage in science-based missions that include adjusting gravity, generating solar energy, launching rockets, and navigating planetary surfaces with rovers. <br><br>Every mechanic is grounded in real-world physics and astronomy, making it both educational and entertaining. Astropark features vibrant environments, intuitive interactions, and a guided progression system that helps players understand key scientific concepts. <br><br>The game is <strong>non-violent</strong> and designed specifically for solo play, making it ideal for classrooms, museums, or curious individuals eager to learn through virtual exploration.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838350?t=1774440840","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838350/9a9f1d244bdbb7571649777f60bc6d097582c51f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774440840","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838350/a9f6efe58008edbd8032fc9805eea5fc86fdf1a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774440840","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838350/a9f6efe58008edbd8032fc9805eea5fc86fdf1a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774440840","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astropark</strong> is an immersive single-player VR game that invites players to explore the wonders of our universe through hands-on, interactive experiences. <br><br><strong>Designed for ages 13</strong> and up, the game is set in a stylized space-themed park where each area represents a real celestial body\u2014such as the Moon, Europa, or Saturn. Players engage in science-based missions that include adjusting gravity, generating solar energy, launching rockets, and navigating planetary surfaces with rovers. <br><br>Every mechanic is grounded in real-world physics and astronomy, making it both educational and entertaining. Astropark features vibrant environments, intuitive interactions, and a guided progression system that helps players understand key scientific concepts. <br><br>The game is <strong>non-violent</strong> and designed specifically for solo play, making it ideal for classrooms, museums, or curious individuals eager to learn through virtual exploration.</p>","developers":["studio soup"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838350/bfb8db40bb5719af4af3e880f520e1f08692cd45/header.jpg?t=1774440840","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838350/1457388035/2fab290ec4f19b61ec8be9c65adff1018b8bed37/1751485731/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751747616","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838350/1457388035/2fab290ec4f19b61ec8be9c65adff1018b8bed37/1751485731/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751747616","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838350/1457388035/2fab290ec4f19b61ec8be9c65adff1018b8bed37/1751485731/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751747616","id":257163871,"name":"Trailer July","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163871/89ea6c6da705c55c36efa36b31f8765f5c3e153a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751747616"}],"name":"Astropark"